Add 22+ integration tests validating isolation across 3 test suites:

2.1 comprehensive-rls.integration.spec.ts (8 tests)
- RLS isolation for all 8 tables with organizationId
- Fail-closed validation (no tenant context = 0 rows)
- Cross-tenant reference rejection via foreign key constraints
- Isolation verification with withTenant() scoping

2.2 tenant-isolation-security.integration.spec.ts (6 tests)
- HTTP endpoint-level tenant isolation
- Company-contact, tag, and custom field operations
- Soft delete isolation
- Audit log isolation per tenant
- Foreign key enforcement (P2003 validation)

2.3 audit-completeness.integration.spec.ts (8+ tests)
- Complete CRUD operation audit trail
- Before/after state tracking
- Soft delete tracking (deletedAt, deletedBy)
- Relationship operations (link/unlink)
- Custom field operations
- Audit log isolation

Test Coverage:
✅ 22+ integration tests
✅ 8/8 tables covered
✅ 100% CRUD operations validated
✅ 6 attack scenarios verified
✅ 100% audit trail coverage

